+
+Desired chains:
+
+## Sales
+
+```text
+Sales
+→ Territory
+→ Salesperson
+→ Customer
+→ Sales Invoice
+→ Sales Invoice Item
+```
+
+## Customer
+
+```text
+Customer
+→ Invoice
+→ Invoice Item
+```
+
+## Product
+
+```text
+Brand
+→ Item Group
+→ Item
+→ Customer
+→ Invoice
+```
+
+## Order Book
+
+```text
+Order Book
+→ Customer
+→ Sales Order
+→ Sales Order Item
+```
+
+Implement drill-down using generic backend metadata/config wherever possible.
+
+Do not create a unique mobile-specific route implementation for every chart.
