+Analyze by:
+
+```text
+Customer
+Salesperson
+Territory
+Branch
+Division
+Brand
+Item Group
+Item
+```
+
+Required management lists:
+
+```text
+Highest GP Customers
+Lowest GP Customers
+Highest GP Products
+Low Margin Sales
+Negative Margin Sales
+High Sales / Low Margin
+Margin Decline vs Comparison Period
+```
